# "You may play that card this turn." (CR 601.3, 514.2): the permission is for this turn only, and declining it is
# allowed. Turn 3: the Treasure is sacrificed and the top card of Bot1's library (a Lightning Bolt) is exiled but not
# played; on Bot1's next turn it has the Mountain, Mox Ruby and Mox Jet untapped and could pay {R}, so the cast is possible only
# if the grant outlived the turn - the refusal and the card still in exile fail a grant that never expires.

